                            What is a getter?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="encapsulationQuestionThree"
                         class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                         data-bs-parent="#encapsulationQuestions">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            A getter is a method used to retrieve the value of
                            an encapsulated field.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed"
                                type="button"
                                data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                data-bs-target="#encapsulationQuestionFour">

                            What is a setter?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="encapsulationQuestionFour"
                         class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                         data-bs-parent="#encapsulationQuestions">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            A setter is a method that changes the value of an
